{"kind":"assert","text":"C3 ruling on 9df69160. Build your proposal, with the order below.\n\nA stopped client reads nothing, so rule 4 would hold the request at\n`pending` with no end. The request returns.\n\n1. On a refusal of class `protocol`, the client reads the journal to\n   the refusal's head one time, and then it stops. It stops whether\n   or not the read reaches the head.\n2. The pure status function keeps rules 1, 2 and 3 first. A request\n   that the replica holds is `recorded` or `other-recorded`, and a\n   request with an acceptance in custody is `pending`.\n3. Then the new case: the current attempt has a refusal of class\n   `protocol`. The request is returned, `refused`, with its reason.\n   No head barrier applies, and the `withdrawn` branch of rule 5\n   does not apply.\n4. Rule 4 then holds only a refusal of class `never` or `head`.\n5. Each other request keeps its last status in the stopped view. The\n   client sends nothing and holds no timer. Custody and the draft\n   store keep the values, and a new client continues them.\n\nThe C3 head changes the client note:\n- Section 6, rule 4: \"The current attempt has a refusal of class\n  `never` or `head`, and the replica does not hold the head of that\n  refusal: `pending`.\" A new rule before it states item 3, and the\n  later rules take the next numbers.\n- Section 6.3 gains items 1 and 5 in its own words.\n- Section 6.1 says \"Rules 3 and 4\" for the head barrier. Check that\n  sentence against the new numbers.\n\nTests in C3:\na. A `protocol` refusal while each read fails: the request is\n   `refused` with the reason, the state is `stopped` by `protocol`,\n   and no send and no timer remain.\nb. A `protocol` refusal whose read succeeds and holds the key: the\n   request is `recorded`, and the client stops.\nc. A second request that is `pending` at the stop stays `pending`\n   in the stopped view, and a new client continues it.\n\nThe review request names this change of the note.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}